   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 186 - 235 (Roll no. 613).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "17:50:52",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "17:46:16",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Bonamici motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment to section 2, Clarification of Joint Employment, to change the applicability when a franchisee takes an action at the direction of a franchisor, and such action by the franchisee violates this Act, in which case the franchisor shall be considered a joint employer for purposes of such violation.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "17:45:58",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Education and Workforce Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsed00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsed00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Ms. Bonamici moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on Education and the Workforce. (text: CR H8579)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "17:45:23",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "16:37:26",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 3441.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "16:36:20",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3043 and H.R. 3441. Measure will be considered read. The resolution provides for one hour of debate on H.R. 3043. The resolution makes in order only those further amendments printed in the report and one motion to recommit with or without instructions. Also, the resolution provides for one hour of debate on H.R. 3441 with one motion to recommit with or without instructions.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "16:36:15",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 607. (consideration: CR H8566-8581)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-07",
   "actionTime": "13:58:11",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 607 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2017-11-06",
   "actionTime": "19:20:25",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 607 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3043 and H.R. 3441. Measure will be considered read. The resolution provides for one hour of debate on H.R. 3043. The resolution makes in order only those further amendments printed in the report and one motion to recommit with or without instructions. Also, the resolution provides for one hour of debate on H.R. 3441 with one motion to recommit with or without instructions.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
